#. Key:	- Actual movement can bypass collision through Sweep=false, Teleport, custom ignore lists, or MovementComponent UpdatedComponent/root mismatch.
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(15)
#: Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(15)
msgctxt "TraceMotive,- Actual movement can bypass collision through Sweep=false, Teleport, custom ignore lists, or MovementComponent UpdatedComponent/root mismatch."
msgid "- Actual movement can bypass collision through Sweep=false, Teleport, custom ignore lists, or MovementComponent UpdatedComponent/root mismatch."
msgstr "- 실제 이동은 Sweep=false, Teleport, 사용자 무시 목록, MovementComponent UpdatedComponent/root 불일치로 충돌을 우회할 수 있습니다."

#. Key:	- Best confirmation is a reproduced swept move with Sweep=true and the returned FHitResult.
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(16)
#: Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(16)
msgctxt "TraceMotive,- Best confirmation is a reproduced swept move with Sweep=true and the returned FHitResult."
msgid "- Best confirmation is a reproduced swept move with Sweep=true and the returned FHitResult."
msgstr "- 가장 좋은 확인은 Sweep=true로 재현한 스윕 이동과 반환된 FHitResult입니다."

#. Key:	- Block possible means settings are compatible with blocking; it is not proof that the real gameplay movement path blocks.
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(17)
#: Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(17)
msgctxt "TraceMotive,- Block possible means settings are compatible with blocking; it is not proof that the real gameplay movement path blocks."
msgid "- Block possible means settings are compatible with blocking; it is not proof that the real gameplay movement path blocks."
msgstr "- Block 가능은 설정이 차단과 호환된다는 뜻이며, 실제 게임플레이 이동 경로가 막힌다는 증명은 아닙니다."

#. Key:	- No obvious Sweep=false or Teleport movement node was found in the selected actors' Blueprint class chain.
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(18)
#: Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(18)
msgctxt "TraceMotive,- No obvious Sweep=false or Teleport movement node was found in the selected actors' Blueprint class chain."
msgid "- No obvious Sweep=false or Teleport movement node was found in the selected actors' Blueprint class chain."
msgstr "- No obvious Sweep=false or Teleport movement node was found in the selected actors' Blueprint class chain."

#. Key:	- PhysicsOnly, Chaos contact resolution, complex BodySetup, and custom primitive collision cannot be fully proven by static/query inspection.
#. SourceLocation:	Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(19)
#: Plugins/TraceMotive/Source/TraceMotive/Private/TMLocTextKeys.cpp(19)
msgctxt "TraceMotive,- PhysicsOnly, Chaos contact resolution, complex BodySetup, and custom primitive collision cannot be fully proven by static/query inspection."
msgid "- PhysicsOnly, Chaos contact resolution, complex BodySetup, and custom primitive collision cannot be fully proven by static/query inspection."
msgstr "- PhysicsOnly, Chaos 접촉 해결, 복잡한 BodySetup, 사용자 정의 Primitive 충돌은 정적/쿼리 검사만으로 완전히 증명할 수 없습니다."

